{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10046","headline":"东郊纳凉忆左威卫李录事收昆季太原崔参军三首 三 · 楼頴","name":"东郊纳凉忆左威卫李录事收昆季太原崔参军三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林间求适意，池上得清飙。\n稍稍斜回檝，时时一度桥。\n水光壁际动，山影浪中摇。\n不见李元礼，神仙何处要。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"楼頴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}